      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Please try this launch option and see if it helps: --disable-hw-video-decoding\n\nThis launch options was originally made for people with AMD gpus, but it might also help in your case if your operating system is not able to properly access the hardware decoding of your gpu. This launch option will put the load on the cpu instead, which will be more expensive but more reliable across a wider range of configurations.",
