      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's been two weeks and the issues with AVPro are still not fixed.\n\nAt least let us disable the thing so we don't have to crash/freeze while loading any worlds that just happen to include a video player (ie. most of the worlds)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
