  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-08-08T04:52:03.097Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "AVPro is an endless source of problems for running VRChat on Linux.\n\nAnd now everyone is **forced** to run with AVPro always activated.\n\nA vast mayority of the worlds include a video player for one reason or another. All those worlds become unusable when AVpro crashes the game on Linux.\n\nAVPro is **way too unstable** to have it hardcoded to be always on.\n\nPlease give us a way to disable it when we want to just play VRChat, even without working videos.",
